To: lm-sensors@vger.kernel.org

Dear list users,

Some spam recently received on the lm-sensors list has made gmail
angry. Gmail started bouncing messages back to the list server, which
triggered automatic user unsubscription of the many affected users.

If you have received a notice that you have been unsubscribed, don't
panic! All affected users have been subscribed again already. We are
sorry for the trouble. Spam protection will be improved to guarantee
that this won't happen again.

-- 
